{"nodeId":"kp:21377","contents":[{"id":"lesson-content:book-4:L195:basis-existence-uniqueness","nodeId":"kp:21377","proposedNodeId":null,"kind":"context","origin":"editorial_proposal","title":"空间基底定理的存在性与唯一性证明","scope":"原教案完整存在与唯一性证明；局部平面化为此证明组织方式，不生成新通用方法。","blocks":[{"role":"condition","type":"text","value":"$\\vec e_1,\\vec e_2,\\vec e_3$不共面，故均非零。若$\\vec a$与其中两个共面，由共面判据立即有表示；只需处理与任意两个都不共面的情形。","evidenceIds":["ev:book-4:L195:p8:para71:8daa13"]},{"role":"step","type":"text","value":"任取$O$，作$\\overrightarrow{OA}=\\vec e_1,\\overrightarrow{OB}=\\vec e_2,\\overrightarrow{OC}=\\vec e_3,\\overrightarrow{OP}=\\vec a$。源图第8页。","evidenceIds":["ev:book-4:L195:p9:para72:d9000e"]},{"role":"solution","type":"text","value":"$OA,OB$确定平面$\\alpha$，$OC,OP$确定平面$\\beta$。两平面不重合，否则三基向量共面；又共有点$O$，故交于唯一直线$l$。取$l$上非零向量$\\vec b$，其与$\\vec e_3$不共线。","evidenceIds":["ev:book-4:L195:p9:para72:ecb05e"]},{"role":"solution","type":"text","value":"在$\\alpha$内，$\\vec b$是$\\vec e_1,\\vec e_2$的线性组合；在$\\beta$内，$\\vec a$是$\\vec b,\\vec e_3$的线性组合。代入即得$\\vec a$是三基向量的线性组合，存在性成立。","evidenceIds":["ev:book-4:L195:p9:para73:826ff8"]},{"role":"solution","type":"text","value":"若$\\vec a=\\lambda\\vec e_1+\\mu\\vec e_2+\\nu\\vec e_3=\\lambda^{\\prime}\\vec e_1+\\mu^{\\prime}\\vec e_2+\\nu^{\\prime}\\vec e_3$，则$(\\lambda-\\lambda^{\\prime})\\vec e_1+(\\mu-\\mu^{\\prime})\\vec e_2+(\\nu-\\nu^{\\prime})\\vec e_3=\\vec0$。","evidenceIds":["ev:book-4:L195:p9:para75:26bf72"]},{"role":"condition","type":"text","value":"若某个系数如$\\lambda-\\lambda^{\\prime}$非零，则可除以它。","evidenceIds":["ev:book-4:L195:p9:para76:0b75b8"]},{"role":"solution","type":"text","value":"$\\vec e_1=-\\frac{\\mu-\\mu^{\\prime}}{\\lambda-\\lambda^{\\prime}}\\vec e_2-\\frac{\\nu-\\nu^{\\prime}}{\\lambda-\\lambda^{\\prime}}\\vec e_3$，与三基向量不共面矛盾。","evidenceIds":["ev:book-4:L195:p9:para77:8d917a"]},{"role":"solution","type":"text","value":"所以三个系数均为零，$\\lambda=\\lambda^{\\prime},\\mu=\\mu^{\\prime},\\nu=\\nu^{\\prime}$，唯一性成立。","evidenceIds":["ev:book-4:L195:p9: